[58.729, "o", "**BigQuery Guidelines Skill** (`urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines`)\r\n\r\n- **Type:** `application/ai-skill` \u2014 offline skill, no auth required (Tier 0, free)\r\n- **Description:** SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering strategies, window functions, and schema design for analytical queries.\r\n- **Capabilities:**\r\n  - SQL query optimization\r\n  - Partitioning & clustering design\r\n  - Analytical schema design\r\n  - Window function recipes\r\n- **Representative queries:** optimize BigQuery SQL, partitioning/clustering table design, analytical schema best practices, avoiding full table scans.\r\n- **Source:** `https://github.com/google/skills` (`skills/bigquery/SKILL.md`)\r\n\r\nSince it's Tier 0, it's ready to use offline with no GCP credentials. Want me to load its full skill content?\r\n"]
